        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e5b9ba/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-12-15T21:46:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I put in an order in late october for Villians and a few minipacks for SotM and also the two expansions that were preorder for Sentinel Tactics. &nbsp;Three questions.</p><p>1) &nbsp;Will I have to wait for the Tactics expansions to be published before i get my SotM stuff since it should be out very soon?</p><p>2) &nbsp;Will I get the new holiday Promo Cards if I have to wait for Tactics to published?</p><p>3) &nbsp;If I have to wait is there a way for me to split the order so I can get the promos and SotM in the near future?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:56.509Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
