        "created_at": "2015-12-16T14:48:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just made a second purchase so that I do get the promo cards. &nbsp;But still need to know if the Villians and the mini-packs will ship when you recieve them or am I stuck waiting for for the tactics...if so, I might consider just cancelling my order. &nbsp;I can always order them from miniture market or other places at a lot lower cost.</p>",
